    "# Day 1: Complex Vector Spaces, Hilbert Spaces, and Dirac Notation\n",
    "\n",
    "**12-Week Quantum Computing Roadmap — Phase 1: Quantum Information Foundations**\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## Learning Objectives\n",
    "\n",
    "By the end of this notebook, you will be able to:\n",
    "\n",
