    "---\n",
    "## 9. Key Takeaways\n",
    "\n",
    "| Concept | Core statement |\n",
    "|---------|----------------|\n",
    "| Complex vector space | Set closed under addition and scalar multiplication over C |\n",
    "| Inner product | Conjugate-linear in 1st arg (physics convention), linear in 2nd |\n",
    "| Hilbert space | Complete inner product space; finite-dim always complete |\n",
    "| Ket | Column vector; the state of a quantum system |\n",
    "| Bra | Conjugate transpose of ket; linear functional |\n",
    "| Bra-ket | Scalar; the inner product |\n",
    "| Ket-bra | Matrix; a rank-1 operator (outer product) |\n",
    "| Completeness | Sum of projectors over any ONB equals identity |\n",
    "| Hermitian | Observable; real eigenvalues; diagonalizable in ONB |\n",
    "| Unitary | Quantum gate; preserves inner products; U†U = I |\n",
    "| Spectral theorem | Every normal operator diagonalizes in some ONB |\n",
    "\n",
    "### Critical Formula Reference\n",
    "\n",
    "**Inner product (physics convention):**\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\\langle u | v \\rangle = \\sum_i u_i^* v_i = (u^\\dagger v)_{11}$$\n",
    "\n",
    "**Resolution of identity:**\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\\sum_i |e_i\\rangle\\langle e_i| = \\mathbb{I}$$\n",
    "\n",
    "**Trace identity:**\n",
    "\n",
    "$$\\text{Tr}(|u\\rangle\\langle v|) = \\langle v|u\\rangle$$\n",
    "\n",
    "**Spectral decomposition:**\n",
    "\n",
    "$$A = \\sum_i \\lambda_i |e_i\\rangle\\langle e_i| \\implies f(A) = \\sum_i f(\\lambda_i)|e_i\\rangle\\langle e_i|$$\n",
